# Anything captured from a real Docker host describes that host: image names,
# container names, volume names. Real captures must never be committed. The
# synthetic ones that ship with the tests live in /tests/fixtures/ and are not ignored.
# Anchored to the repository root so that a rule never swallows a directory of the
# package itself.
/captures/
/data/
*.local.*
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

